{"id":"85a2ae5fb67dda7f","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-baer-criterion.md","title":"Baer's Criterion","display":"thm-baer-criterion — Baer's Criterion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-baer-criterion","aliases":["58-thm-baer-criterion"],"display":"thm-baer-criterion — Baer's Criterion","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-baer-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-baer-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-baer-criterion — Baer's Criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e6a1ed8511f909f2\" href=\"?note=e6a1ed8511f909f2\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md\">../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E\\in V\">\\(R,E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\)</span> 是结构参数完全显式的左模谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\)</span> 是结构参数完全显式的左理想谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e6a1ed8511f909f2\" href=\"?note=e6a1ed8511f909f2\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md\">../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\)</span> 是集合函数谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StructuredInjectiveModule}_S,\\mathrm{BaerExtensionCondition}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{StructuredInjectiveModule}_S,\\mathrm{BaerExtensionCondition}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> 是本文件定义的、共享同一组环与模运算的谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baer\\text{-}structured\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredInjectiveModule}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_E)\\land\n\\forall M,N,+_M,0_M,\\odot_M,+_N,0_N,\\odot_N,i,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(N,R,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,M,N)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\bigl(i(x+_My)=i(x)+_Ni(y)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(i(r\\odot_Mx)=r\\odot_Ni(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\bigl(i(x)=i(y)\\to x=y\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\bigl(f(x+_My)=f(x)+_Ef(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(f(r\\odot_Mx)=r\\odot_Ef(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,N,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;\\bigl(g(x+_Ny)=g(x)+_Eg(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;\\bigl(g(r\\odot_Nx)=r\\odot_Eg(x)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(g(i(x))=f(x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baer\\text{-}structured\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredInjectiveModule}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_E)\\land\n\\forall M,N,+_M,0_M,\\odot_M,+_N,0_N,\\odot_N,i,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(N,R,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,M,N)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\bigl(i(x+_My)=i(x)+_Ni(y)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(i(r\\odot_Mx)=r\\odot_Ni(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\bigl(i(x)=i(y)\\to x=y\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\bigl(f(x+_My)=f(x)+_Ef(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(f(r\\odot_Mx)=r\\odot_Ef(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,N,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;\\bigl(g(x+_Ny)=g(x)+_Eg(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;\\bigl(g(r\\odot_Nx)=r\\odot_Eg(x)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(g(i(x))=f(x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baer\\text{-}extension\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaerExtensionCondition}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_E)\\land\n\\forall I,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;\\bigl(f(x+_Ry)=f(x)+_Ef(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;\\bigl(f(r\\cdot_Rx)=r\\odot_Ef(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,R,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in R\\;\\bigl(g(x+_Ry)=g(x)+_Eg(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\land\\forall r,x\\in R\\;\\bigl(g(r\\cdot_Rx)=r\\odot_Eg(x)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\bigl(g(x)=f(x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baer\\text{-}extension\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BaerExtensionCondition}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_E)\\land\n\\forall I,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;\\bigl(f(x+_Ry)=f(x)+_Ef(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;\\bigl(f(r\\cdot_Rx)=r\\odot_Ef(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,R,E)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in R\\;\\bigl(g(x+_Ry)=g(x)+_Eg(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\land\\forall r,x\\in R\\;\\bigl(g(r\\cdot_Rx)=r\\odot_Eg(x)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\bigl(g(x)=f(x)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baer\\text{-}criterion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredInjectiveModule}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BaerExtensionCondition}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baer\\text{-}criterion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StructuredInjectiveModule}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BaerExtensionCondition}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,\\odot_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Baer 判据量化所有左理想，而不只是主理想。</li>\n<li>对 PID <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-模内射等价于可除；只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\mathbb Z\">\\(R=\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 时这才专门表述为可除阿贝尔群。</li>\n<li>Characterizes injective modules without requiring all submodules.</li>\n<li>Foundation for constructing injective envelopes.</li>\n<li>环运算、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的加法与作用在两侧完全共享；这避免了载集级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Module}(E,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Module}(E,R)\\)</span> 与载集级同态各自重新选择不相容结构的语义分叉。</li>\n<li>原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\leq{}_RR\">\\(I\\leq{}_RR\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_R(-,-)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_R(-,-)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g|_I\">\\(g|_I\\)</span> 均未注册；现已分别替换为左理想谓词、逐点同态律与逐点延拓等式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved